WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.680
FALLEN HEROES

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.080
This is lame!

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.840
Hey! How about a little respect?

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.920
Elely, Iops may be dumb and impulsive,
but one thing's for sure,

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.720
they don't give up easily.

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:33.400
How did you do that? You're so strong!

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.720
A lot less than I used to be.
A whole lot less.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.440
Do you miss your arm?

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:43.720
It was my favorite arm,
my best punching arm in fact.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.000
Of course I miss it, but it's not so bad.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.600
I could have lost a lot more.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:52.560
Don't you miss your adventures with Mama?

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.680
You guys are our adventure now, sweetie.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.120
Okay, I miss it a little sometimes.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.640
Your mother and I met
in the middle of a battle.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.720
It doesn't get more romantic than that!

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.920
And adventure after adventure,

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.800
the villains we took on
only got more powerful.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.320
Nox, the mad Xelor...

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.720
Rushu, the mad demon,
and Qilby, the mad Eliatrope.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.520
-Ogrest...
-The mad ogre?

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.080
Yeah, how'd you guess?

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:31.960
That was the biggest one.
Yugo helped take him down.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.760
You caught that dragon by the horns.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:58.960
It's crazy how you and Yugo managed
to win the fight! It was so cool!

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:08.320
It was great. And an arm isn't
a high price for a fight like that!

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:15.720
You gave that Ogrest the beating
of his life and with that dragon you...

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.120
Dally!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:23.600
You're still outside?

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.520
Speaking of dragons...

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.920
I heard that, Iop brain.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.080
You need to stop all this training.
It's freezing.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.280
-You'll catch cold dressed that way.
-Get used to it!

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.640
Soon I'll have another little Iop
to teach the ropes to.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:40.640
Please don't.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.480
Ah, they're so gross.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.960
And I've seen them do much worse.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.200
Rubi!

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:56.280
Not my fault if you forget to take me off
the wall when you do private exercises.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.600
Enough, Rubi, we get the idea.

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.080
You dirty old Shushu.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.280
I can't believe this!

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.520
Such a bad temper.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.600
She inherited it from her mother.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.360
It's going to be very cold tonight.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:24.200
Let's eat before the soup is
as cold as we are.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.840
Again with the soup?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.240
Set the table, kids.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.360
-It's Flopin's turn!
-In your dreams, Iop head!

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:49.760
Flopin, put out the spoons.
Elely, get the bowls. Quick!

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.040
It's not fair!

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.800
-I love your soup, Mama.
-Big suck-up!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.320
No, if I was a suck-up,

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.600
I'd tell Mama about
your mega training session tomorrow,

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:08.560
a trek through snow,
swimming in an icy river...

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:11.280
-A whole load of stupid Iop stuff.
-What?

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:12.680
Traitor!

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.960
Look outside, Dally! No way
are you two going out tomorrow.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:22.440
We can't just sit by the fireside all day.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.240
In this weather,
that's what normal people do!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:28.480
Someone's at the door.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:32.560
It's probably just the beams creaking.
We're alone out here.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.200
Okay, not the beams.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:50.040
Hello, good sir.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:55.720
The storm took me by surprise and...
I don't have the right gear with me.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.440
There's a bear at the door who says
he's cold. But you have fur.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.400
Hello, everyone. I'm a Pandawa.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:07.720
Stop being so rude and let him in.
The poor thing must be frozen solid.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.760
Thank you!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.840
I have to ask you
to leave your weapons at the door.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.160
All of them?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.880
Why? How many have you got?

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.200
Oh, a few.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.520
I feel like I've lost 200 pounds.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.800
All right, I think that's it.

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.520
Not all of it.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.640
What do you mean, not all of it?
I already feel naked.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:49.320
Steady, I was talking about your balls.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.240
You must mean these.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:59.920
These are my marbles.
The kids and I can play a match later on.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:01.840
Cool!

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.880
In any case, noble family,

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.480
thank you for your hospitality.

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.640
You haven't tried Mama's soup yet.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:15.080
My name is Poo, Pandawa adventurer.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:18.200
Hello, Poo. We're the Sadlygrove family.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:24.040
These are our children, Elely and Flopin,
my husband, Percedal, and I'm Evangelyne.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:32.880
You... You're Percedal and Evangelyne
from the Brotherhood of the Tofu?

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:37.760
Well, even in the middle of nowhere,
people know our names.

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:41.440
I can't believe I've run into you.

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.440
What luck!

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.760
You're not just famous, you're legends.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:52.880
You, Princess Amalia, the great
Ruel Stroud, Yugo the Eliatrope...

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:56.240
You all became legends.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:18.440
Amalia?

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:21.520
Amalia!

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:24.040
Aren't you enjoying your meal?

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:27.080
Of course, it's delicious.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.640
But your mind is elsewhere, little sister.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.160
We'll take your mind off
whatever's bothering you.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.960
Don't worry about me, Aurora.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:43.120
I wanted to introduce you to someone
you have a lot in common with.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.760
Mighty Sadidas, good day.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:57.200
You may rise, Ashdur! Now give us
a little overview of your talents.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.680
Right! A show of strength!

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:19.800
Oh, bravo! How magnificent!

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.000
Yeah, it's good. And who is that?

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:25.000
I thought you'd introduced me
to all your brothers.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.040
Amalia, show the lady some respect!

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:33.040
It's all right, my prince,
Amalia didn't mean any harm.

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:37.000
She's right,
but when will you realize I'm not a child

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.480
and I know what you are trying to do?

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.440
You're her cousin, right?

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:46.760
Yeah, I knew it!

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.440
Even family dinners
are all about politics.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.560
-But--
-From now on, I'll eat in my room.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.520
What a little brat!

00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:01.440
Don't worry, my prince. We'll weed
the disobedience out of her in the end.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.360
Father... You have to get better soon.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:32.880
Without you, the Sadida Kingdom
is a shadow of what it was.

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:40.840
You've had another fight
with your brother, haven't you?

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.120
His wife is just as pushy as he is.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:47.880
They're trying so hard.

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:57.440
I can't do this without you.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.640
Do you know how much
you look like your mother?

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:07.440
Soon, I will join her and the prospect...
fills me with joy.

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:12.040
And you, my little bud, you will blossom.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:18.520
You just need to find out which way
to turn to receive the love you need.

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.800
I already know what I need, Father.

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:38.600
It's the third time
we've come looking for Adamai.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.720
I don't see why your brother
is in these ruins.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:55.320
I'm sorry about before, but...

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:58.120
You need the Dofus.
I told you I don't agree.

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:01.760
-What's got into you?
-I'm the one who should be sensible?

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:05.560
You're risking the world for Dally!
I won't give you the Dofus.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:10.200
We've always been there for each other,
Ad, and Dally is like a brother to us.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:14.040
Do you think he'd want you
to risk the world to save him

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.360
and put Eva and the children in danger?

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.520
I'll be careful, Ad.

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:20.800
You don't even know how to use them.

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:22.680
-I'm learning fast.
-Really?

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:26.360
Ad, the Dofus are being used
for bad reasons.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:29.280
They are in the process
of destroying the world.

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.080
We can change that with ours!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:33.880
No!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.960
I will not change my mind, Yugo.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:58.320
You have to choose
between your friend and your brother.

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.840
If I listen to you, Ad...

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.680
...there wouldn't be anyone left
to choose between.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.040
I love you, brother.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:14.840
I don't understand.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.040
We were looking for him for months.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.680
He can't just have disappeared.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.720
That sure was good!

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.640
Yup, he's definitely a Pandawa.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:49.280
I want to give you something
for your kind hospitality.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:54.160
Children, I'm going to lend you my balls.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.240
Awesome!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:15:00.240
The idea is simple.
You have to wait until they light up,

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:03.440
then you'll get an unforgettable show.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:10.800
As for you, my kind hosts,
I want to show you an unforgettable trick.

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.360
All right! I love tricks!

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:22.840
Here we go! It's starting!

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.640
Dally! No!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.440
Mama!

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:57.000
You didn't come here
out of pure chance, you hairball.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:59.840
There's no room for chance
in this world.

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:02.480
Tell me what you want. It'll be quicker.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:05.480
Your children and Eva,
since she's pregnant.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.160
Save your breath, Poo.
Get him out of the way.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.760
He won't let us leave without a struggle.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:17.720
There's no hurry, Toxine.
Take Eva outside. Silo, you follow her.

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:23.640
My blade is poisoned, Sir Percedal.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:27.280
If it touches her neck,
you'll never see her again.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.240
The children, take care of the children.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:37.400
You took me by surprise,
but it won't happen again.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.360
-Dirty...
-I'm not the only one.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:07.560
-She learned that from me.
-Behind you, Papa!

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.200
He's good.

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:34.440
Hide in the forest, kids!
I'll get your mother.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.800
In your dreams!
We're going back to crush 'em!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.800
Flopin, you go hide, okay?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:47.280
You're pregnant, Evangelyne.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:49.840
Don't put your baby in harm's way.

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:52.880
Thanks for the advice!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:18.600
Hurry up and get them before they escape.

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:20.160
Before we escape?

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.040
Why would we try to escape?

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:27.760
Maybe they think we're afraid, Eva,
but I'm sure we just kicked their butts.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.200
A major spanking!

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:31.760
Can I go get them, Papa? Please say I can!

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.400
I'm not sure, you can never tell,
maybe they are dangerous.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:39.880
Stop acting like we don't exist!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:05.360
You're doing pretty well,
but you're making a grave error

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:06.840
by underestimating us.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.800
&lt;i&gt;Shut up, Poo! You three are ridiculous!&lt;/i&gt;

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:12.240
No, wait, let us finish!

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:13.880
You promised you'd let...

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:16.160
&lt;i&gt;Shut up and watch!&lt;/i&gt;

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:17.720
That voice...

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.760
Adamai?

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:57.000
Eva, take the kids
and get as far away as you can.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.680
-But...
-Fast!

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:09.120
You're not going to like this,
but we need to take your children.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.360
We have very big plans for them.

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.680
Yeah? Well, I've got a big plan, too.

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:16.920
Making sure you never attack
my family again!

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:35.640
Show-off!

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:37.080
His... His back...

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.840
Those are... the Eliatrope Dofus.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:44.280
Not bad, huh? They give my powers a boost.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.920
But... Goultard was guarding them.

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:50.480
Yes, it wasn't easy taking them from him.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:53.440
He's an Iop god,
you can't have beaten him.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.640
I cheated a little.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:59.440
Adamai, I don't know what happened,
but we can figure this out.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:00.520
Mama!

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.440
I've always dreamed of doing that.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:07.680
Honestly, Dally,
I don't know how you can stand her.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.000
Are you even trying now, my friend?

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:16.120
It's almost... annoying.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:21.920
Papa!

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:32.840
What happened to you?
We used to be like brothers!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:35.440
I have new brothers now.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.840
A family who opened up my eyes.

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:44.880
I know what I have to do
with people like you. It's crystal-clear.

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.360
People like me?

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:50.680
All of you must be stopped... now!

00:21:55.240 --> 00:22:00.040
I don't know what you're talking about.
All I know is Yugo will never forgive you.

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:03.360
Yugo? Do you want to say hi to him?

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:06.920
Dally...

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.640
Let me go!

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:11.720
As you wish!

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:19.920
Dally!

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:35.080
I won't leave you alone, Papa.

00:22:35.640 --> 00:22:37.440
My darling little Iop...

00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:50.040
Ad... Sorry, the little girl got away.

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:55.240
Even guarding a little girl
is too much to ask?

00:22:55.800 --> 00:22:59.200
Well, you and your superpowers
couldn't stop her either.

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:08.200
I suppose you're right, Poo,
I'm sorry I got carried away.

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.840
Go find them... and meet me at the tower.

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:30.800
Papa!

